WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:42.730
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:43.000 --> 01:48.020
[When I Meet The Moon]

3
01:48.090 --> 01:51.050
[Episode 26]

4
02:01.010 --> 02:02.210
You once told me

5
02:04.030 --> 02:05.030
that looking at me

6
02:06.260 --> 02:07.860
was like looking at the moon.

7
02:12.570 --> 02:13.500
But at that time,

8
02:18.060 --> 02:19.090
I was no longer

9
02:19.090 --> 02:20.560
the moon you saw before.

10
02:24.360 --> 02:25.590
During that time,

11
02:26.750 --> 02:27.750
I was

12
02:29.460 --> 02:30.720
a terrible boyfriend.

13
02:32.360 --> 02:34.090
I had no right to ask you to stay,

14
02:35.280 --> 02:35.930
and I didn't even

15
02:35.930 --> 02:37.150
apologize to you.

16
02:37.810 --> 02:38.960
Don't say that. I...

17
02:38.980 --> 02:40.640
During the time we were apart,

18
02:41.030 --> 02:42.230
I did a lot of thinking

19
02:43.360 --> 02:44.620
and changed a lot.

20
02:48.090 --> 02:51.090
So you came back to Xifu because of me?

21
02:52.090 --> 02:52.680
Yes.

22
02:55.460 --> 02:56.990
This is what I can do for you,

23
02:59.090 --> 03:00.950
and what I'm willing to do for you.

24
03:07.410 --> 03:09.210
You wanted me to go back to school

25
03:09.690 --> 03:11.290
and return to how I used to be.

26
03:12.590 --> 03:13.390
Now,

27
03:14.900 --> 03:16.700
I have become that person again.

28
03:22.670 --> 03:23.460
Fu Shize.

29
03:25.060 --> 03:28.190
Actually, there's something I haven’t told you either.

30
03:29.470 --> 03:30.840
When I was with you,

31
03:31.710 --> 03:33.440
I actually felt very inferior.

32
03:34.310 --> 03:35.310
Whenever you

33
03:36.620 --> 03:38.630
didn't say or do anything,

34
03:39.970 --> 03:40.930
I felt that

35
03:40.930 --> 03:42.990
you didn't like me that much anymore.

36
03:45.530 --> 03:47.590
When I couldn't reach you back then,

37
03:45.760 --> 03:47.650
♪ Dreams folded by the rain ♪

38
03:47.610 --> 03:49.090
I thought you wanted to break up with me

39
03:47.680 --> 03:49.010
♪ Still crystal clear ♪

40
03:49.040 --> 03:52.270
♪ Clouds stitching up the colors of every break ♪

41
03:50.150 --> 03:52.190
because of my dad.

42
03:52.290 --> 03:54.620
♪ Borrowing a beam of moonlight ♪

43
03:53.740 --> 03:54.910
When Yun Ye was sick,

44
03:54.780 --> 03:57.790
♪ To smooth over the uneasy past ♪

45
03:54.910 --> 03:56.020
I really hoped

46
03:56.020 --> 03:57.400
you could be by my side.

47
03:58.750 --> 04:00.870
I didn't know you were sick.

48
04:00.170 --> 04:02.820
♪ Who is it by my ear ♪

49
04:01.840 --> 04:02.780
I just thought

50
04:02.780 --> 04:04.680
you didn't like me anymore.

51
04:02.840 --> 04:06.320
♪ Casting shouts into the dark night? ♪

52
04:05.630 --> 04:06.560
After we broke up,

53
04:06.560 --> 04:07.780
you didn't come looking for me either.

54
04:07.040 --> 04:11.820
♪ Filling every crack in the clouds ♪

55
04:07.780 --> 04:08.580
So I thought

56
04:09.340 --> 04:10.460
that maybe

57
04:11.060 --> 04:13.120
you'd long wanted to break up with me.

58
04:13.450 --> 04:16.079
♪ Echoes folding into paper boats ♪

59
04:16.100 --> 04:19.640
♪ Drifting down the river, around the shallows ♪

60
04:18.800 --> 04:19.360
Then...

61
04:20.100 --> 04:25.330
♪ Heading your way, with no turning back ♪

62
04:22.130 --> 04:23.800
Then why didn't you come to me?

63
04:24.430 --> 04:25.950
I wanted to.

64
04:26.640 --> 04:29.360
♪ Burying regrets deep in the soil ♪

65
04:27.950 --> 04:30.510
I just felt I wasn't good enough.

66
04:29.380 --> 04:32.540
♪ Waiting for a meeting to light up the loneliness ♪

67
04:31.360 --> 04:33.120
What I said back then was out of anger.

68
04:32.680 --> 04:34.310
♪ Moonlight gently sways ♪

69
04:33.120 --> 04:34.180
I never really wanted

70
04:34.180 --> 04:35.390
to break up with you.

71
04:34.330 --> 04:36.060
♪ Stars fall upon my shoulder ♪

72
04:36.090 --> 04:38.810
♪ Look at me ♪

73
04:36.690 --> 04:38.890
I regretted it so much.

74
04:38.840 --> 04:43.510
♪ The long night slows down ♪

75
04:40.420 --> 04:41.330
And I was afraid

76
04:42.040 --> 04:43.500
that with my personality,

77
04:43.659 --> 04:44.890
if I came to you again,

78
04:43.990 --> 04:45.880
♪ Dreams folded by the rain ♪

79
04:45.909 --> 04:47.240
♪ Still crystal clear ♪

80
04:46.240 --> 04:46.740
we would

81
04:46.740 --> 04:48.100
break up again

82
04:47.270 --> 04:50.500
♪ Clouds stitching up the colors of every break ♪

83
04:48.159 --> 04:49.300
because of me.

84
04:50.360 --> 04:51.750
So I went abroad.

85
04:50.520 --> 04:52.850
♪ Borrowing a beam of moonlight ♪

86
04:53.010 --> 04:56.020
♪ To smooth over the uneasy past ♪

87
04:53.950 --> 04:55.010
But this past year,

88
04:55.240 --> 04:57.659
I tried very hard to change myself.

89
04:56.050 --> 05:03.300
♪ Picking up scattered light at my fingertips with you ♪

90
04:58.480 --> 04:59.860
I tried hard to learn

91
04:59.860 --> 05:01.070
how to communicate with people

92
05:01.070 --> 05:03.270
and be someone with a good personality.

93
05:04.050 --> 05:05.690
I tried so hard.

94
05:05.970 --> 05:07.900
I don't want us to be apart anymore.

95
05:14.530 --> 05:17.190
♪ My steps drag slow ♪

96
05:17.210 --> 05:20.320
♪ Spinning where I stand ♪

97
05:20.950 --> 05:26.010
♪ Like a sail tangled in the night ♪

98
05:27.910 --> 05:30.440
♪ Answers will come in time ♪

99
05:30.460 --> 05:33.770
♪ Though the path is rough and unsteady ♪

100
05:33.800 --> 05:39.050
♪ Stubbornness will blow the mist away ♪

101
05:40.750 --> 05:43.850
♪ Turn around, listening to the passing crowd ♪

102
05:43.880 --> 05:46.909
♪ Hesitant unease brushes my face ♪

103
05:46.930 --> 05:48.560
♪ Fingertips mark the way ♪

104
05:48.590 --> 05:50.280
♪ Soft rustling sounds arise ♪

105
05:50.300 --> 05:57.710
♪ Stay with me, no more lost wandering ♪

106
05:51.190 --> 05:52.060
I'm sorry.

107
05:52.830 --> 05:54.240
Fu Shize, I'm sorry.

108
05:54.450 --> 05:56.000
I-If I had

109
05:56.980 --> 05:58.100
told you all this

110
05:58.100 --> 05:59.270
back then

111
05:58.480 --> 06:00.470
♪ The wounds kissed by the wind ♪

112
05:59.500 --> 06:01.680
instead of overthinking things,

113
06:00.490 --> 06:01.890
♪ I remember them all ♪

114
06:01.910 --> 06:05.070
♪ Grains of sand count the depth of every fall ♪

115
06:02.250 --> 06:04.160
we wouldn't have broken up.

116
06:05.090 --> 06:07.400
♪ Still fearing the collision ♪

117
06:07.420 --> 06:10.670
♪ Like a scorching heat on a cosmic scale ♪

118
06:11.360 --> 06:12.160
Lili.

119
06:11.450 --> 06:13.340
♪ Dreams folded by the rain ♪

120
06:13.370 --> 06:14.700
♪ Still crystal clear ♪

121
06:14.730 --> 06:17.960
♪ Clouds stitching up the colors of every break ♪

122
06:17.980 --> 06:20.310
♪ Borrowing a beam of moonlight ♪

123
06:20.390 --> 06:25.670
♪ To smooth over the uneasy past ♪

124
06:23.430 --> 06:25.060
We will never be apart again.

125
06:26.730 --> 06:33.990
♪ Picking up scattered light at my fingertips with you ♪

126
06:57.040 --> 07:04.300
♪ Picking up scattered light at my fingertips with you ♪

127
07:33.659 --> 07:34.450
Fu Shize.

128
07:38.159 --> 07:39.130
Why are you here?

129
07:39.130 --> 07:40.460
To bring you breakfast.

130
07:44.159 --> 07:44.950
Let me do it.

131
07:45.930 --> 07:47.250
Are you super busy today?

132
07:47.250 --> 07:48.360
You came so early.

133
07:50.740 --> 07:51.540
It's alright.

134
07:51.830 --> 07:53.490
I made you fish fillet congee.

135
07:54.240 --> 07:55.100
The ingredients are at the bottom.

136
07:55.100 --> 07:55.900
There's a lot.

137
07:58.860 --> 08:00.750
-It’s a bit hot. -You didn’t tell me you were coming.

138
08:00.750 --> 08:02.950
I was afraid of interrupting your work.

139
08:03.740 --> 08:05.160
Senior, have you eaten?

140
08:05.160 --> 08:06.630
I brought you breakfast.

141
08:07.860 --> 08:08.860
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

142
08:08.860 --> 08:09.830
I'll come back later.

143
08:09.830 --> 08:10.300
No need.

144
08:10.300 --> 08:11.540
I... I was just about to leave.

145
08:11.540 --> 08:12.430
I'll leave you to it. I'm leaving.

146
08:12.430 --> 08:13.010
You're leaving?

147
08:13.010 --> 08:13.370
Bye-bye.

148
08:13.370 --> 08:14.070
Leaving so soon?

149
08:14.070 --> 08:15.330
I'm leaving. Bye-bye.

150
08:28.950 --> 08:31.610
This egg pancake doesn't taste as good anymore.

151
08:34.700 --> 08:37.830
Your girlfriend came all the way to bring you breakfast?

152
08:38.360 --> 08:39.150
Jealous?

153
08:47.530 --> 08:48.340
Get up.

154
08:48.530 --> 08:49.340
Go eat over there.

155
08:49.340 --> 08:50.100
I...

156
08:51.090 --> 08:52.670
Love really does

157
08:52.780 --> 08:54.180
change people.

158
09:13.980 --> 09:15.000
I'm heading back now.

159
09:15.000 --> 09:16.330
See you this afternoon.

160
09:17.820 --> 09:18.290
Okay.

161
09:24.480 --> 09:25.620
If they give me gifts,

162
09:25.620 --> 09:26.550
I have to accept them.

163
09:26.550 --> 09:28.410
Couldn't you just turn them down?

164
09:28.500 --> 09:30.120
No, they are Yun Li's fans.

165
09:30.120 --> 09:31.130
They like my sister.

166
09:31.130 --> 09:32.430
I have to be polite to them.

167
09:32.430 --> 09:33.890
You don't need to explain to me.

168
09:33.890 --> 09:35.080
I'm not your girlfriend.

169
09:35.080 --> 09:35.790
No matter how many love letters you receive,

170
09:35.790 --> 09:37.190
you don't need to tell me.

171
09:38.560 --> 09:39.200
YY.

172
09:39.740 --> 09:40.530
Yunyi!

173
09:41.940 --> 09:42.730
Yun Ye.

174
09:45.000 --> 09:45.650
Coming.

175
09:49.700 --> 09:50.670
Why are you here?

176
09:50.860 --> 09:52.860
I came to pass something to Fu Shize.

177
09:53.700 --> 09:54.830
Don't slam the door!

178
09:57.210 --> 09:58.160
What's wrong?

179
09:58.460 --> 09:59.790
Did you fight with Yunyi?

180
09:59.790 --> 10:00.600
No.

181
10:01.530 --> 10:02.860
What exactly happened?

182
10:03.290 --> 10:04.390
I just said hi

183
10:04.390 --> 10:05.600
to one of your fans.

184
10:05.860 --> 10:06.650
I didn't say anything else.

185
10:06.650 --> 10:07.740
And then she got angry.

186
10:07.740 --> 10:08.840
She also said

187
10:08.860 --> 10:10.260
she's not my girlfriend.

188
10:12.700 --> 10:14.150
You two finally

189
10:14.150 --> 10:15.630
got into the same university

190
10:15.630 --> 10:17.230
after so many difficulties,

191
10:17.460 --> 10:20.220
and now you're fighting over something so trivial?

192
10:20.220 --> 10:21.370
Fighting is normal.

193
10:21.530 --> 10:22.840
Who doesn't fight?

194
10:23.240 --> 10:24.030
Yes.

195
10:24.030 --> 10:25.250
Fighting is normal.

196
10:25.250 --> 10:26.750
But you shouldn't give each other the cold shoulder.

197
10:26.750 --> 10:28.750
You should explain things clearly.

198
10:29.130 --> 10:30.860
Go quickly. Don't waste time.

199
10:33.820 --> 10:35.910
Li, take me home for now.

200
10:57.340 --> 10:58.130
Senior.

201
10:58.360 --> 10:59.490
Talking about work?

202
11:04.650 --> 11:05.780
Talking about work?

203
11:06.890 --> 11:07.820
What do you mean?

204
11:08.500 --> 11:09.860
Who communicates with their girlfriend

205
11:09.860 --> 11:11.460
through text messages alone?

206
11:11.460 --> 11:12.790
Did you two just meet?

207
11:24.650 --> 11:25.440
Then...

208
11:26.610 --> 11:28.050
When you are in a relationship,

209
11:28.050 --> 11:29.380
how do you usually chat?

210
11:31.200 --> 11:32.730
When I first started dating,

211
11:32.730 --> 11:35.130
I wished we could stick together every day.

212
11:35.360 --> 11:36.360
When we couldn't meet,

213
11:36.360 --> 11:38.020
I would send a WeChat message.

214
11:38.140 --> 11:39.240
When I was bored,

215
11:39.650 --> 11:40.910
I would send a sticker.

216
11:46.150 --> 11:47.790
A sticker?

217
11:55.530 --> 11:56.440
Send me some.

218
11:57.130 --> 11:57.940
Senior.

219
11:58.460 --> 12:00.790
These stickers are a bit too mushy.

220
12:00.860 --> 12:02.550
Don't send it when you just got together.

221
12:02.550 --> 12:03.650
Don't scare her.

222
12:13.030 --> 12:14.130
These stickers

223
12:14.130 --> 12:15.550
are relatively milder.

224
12:16.100 --> 12:18.860
You can send the same one a few times.

225
12:21.340 --> 12:22.130
Thanks.

226
13:11.270 --> 13:11.980
Yunyi!

227
13:14.320 --> 13:15.150
I'm sorry.

228
13:15.630 --> 13:16.860
Whether I did anything wrong or not,

229
13:16.860 --> 13:18.460
just treat it all as my fault.

230
13:18.940 --> 13:20.140
What did you do wrong?

231
13:20.250 --> 13:21.360
As long as you think it's wrong,

232
13:21.360 --> 13:22.360
then it's wrong.

233
13:26.670 --> 13:28.150
Yin Yunyi,

234
13:28.460 --> 13:29.360
I'm sorry.

235
13:29.530 --> 13:30.790
Given my good attitude

236
13:30.790 --> 13:32.130
in admitting my mistakes,

237
13:32.130 --> 13:33.750
can you stop being angry?

238
13:36.740 --> 13:37.630
Wait a minute.

239
13:40.100 --> 13:42.160
Do you remember the stars you gave me?

240
13:44.460 --> 13:46.150
I gave you this jar.

241
13:53.390 --> 13:55.130
And this jar is...

242
13:56.130 --> 13:57.460
I folded these.

243
14:01.700 --> 14:03.160
You know how to fold stars?

244
14:04.250 --> 14:05.290
I didn't before.

245
14:05.560 --> 14:07.290
I learned how to after you left.

246
14:07.700 --> 14:09.390
Since you went to Nanwu,

247
14:09.570 --> 14:10.860
every time I missed you,

248
14:10.860 --> 14:11.860
I folded one.

249
14:14.860 --> 14:15.790
So many.

250
14:17.530 --> 14:18.860
I decided a long time ago

251
14:19.290 --> 14:20.050
that I'd give this to you

252
14:20.050 --> 14:21.030
when I officially confessed

253
14:21.030 --> 14:22.150
my feelings to you.

254
14:40.100 --> 14:41.700
Why is this one so big?

255
14:43.250 --> 14:45.510
Because there's a secret hidden inside.

256
14:58.800 --> 15:01.020
Yin Yunyi from Class 15 of Grade 11,

257
15:01.500 --> 15:02.580
there is something

258
15:02.870 --> 15:04.320
Yun Ye wants to tell you.

259
15:05.270 --> 15:06.390
I like you.

260
15:12.100 --> 15:14.890
Will you be my girlfriend?

261
15:19.550 --> 15:21.890
So, will you say yes?

262
15:26.340 --> 15:27.130
Really?

263
15:28.780 --> 15:30.880
You really said yes? You said yes!

264
15:31.320 --> 15:32.290
Yes! Yes!

265
15:32.290 --> 15:33.250
Yes!

266
15:34.150 --> 15:35.360
Yes!

267
15:36.050 --> 15:38.170
I did it! I did it!

268
15:40.550 --> 15:41.940
I did it! I did it...

269
15:42.720 --> 15:43.510
Yunyi.

270
15:52.340 --> 15:53.340
Want to write one?

271
15:53.940 --> 15:54.530
Yeah.

272
15:57.340 --> 15:58.940
There are sticky notes here.

273
15:59.610 --> 16:01.010
You should write one too.

274
16:13.750 --> 16:14.790
N-No peeking.

275
16:15.550 --> 16:16.360
It's a secret.

276
16:19.200 --> 16:20.000
Okay.

277
16:20.360 --> 16:22.290
Then you can't look at mine either.

278
16:23.630 --> 16:24.460
I won't look.

279
16:31.680 --> 16:32.470
Fu Shize.

280
16:32.500 --> 16:33.940
In the future, when this wish of ours

281
16:33.940 --> 16:34.860
comes true,

282
16:34.860 --> 16:36.840
we'll come back to see it, okay?

283
16:36.940 --> 16:37.740
Okay.

284
16:41.000 --> 16:41.790
I'm done.

285
16:42.860 --> 16:43.920
Put yours up first.

286
16:55.340 --> 16:56.130
Done.

287
16:56.390 --> 16:57.200
I'll help you.

288
16:57.200 --> 16:57.740
No need.

289
16:57.740 --> 16:58.740
I'll do it myself.

290
16:59.460 --> 17:00.440
Turn around.

291
17:00.460 --> 17:01.250
No peeking.

292
17:10.200 --> 17:10.640
Done.

293
17:10.960 --> 17:12.500
I'm done.

294
17:12.589 --> 17:13.349
Let's go.

295
17:13.349 --> 17:14.440
Where did you paste it?

296
17:14.440 --> 17:15.460
Nowhere.

297
17:18.740 --> 17:19.530
Yin.

298
17:19.660 --> 17:21.790
Do you have any plans to return to Xifu?

299
17:22.050 --> 17:22.849
Of course.

300
17:23.000 --> 17:24.730
After all, this is my hometown.

301
17:24.940 --> 17:26.550
Our company is planning to set up

302
17:26.550 --> 17:27.740
a research department in Xifu.

303
17:27.740 --> 17:28.750
After a while,

304
17:28.750 --> 17:30.280
I'll go back to work in Xifu.

305
17:30.460 --> 17:31.250
That's good.

306
17:31.500 --> 17:32.670
It's good for young people

307
17:32.670 --> 17:34.220
to be ambitious.

308
17:35.400 --> 17:36.200
You're back.

309
17:36.240 --> 17:37.750
Come, sit down.

310
17:40.230 --> 17:41.470
Let me tell you, Yin.

311
17:42.520 --> 17:43.030
As for me,

312
17:43.030 --> 17:44.600
although I'm not highly educated,

313
17:44.600 --> 17:45.810
I'm quite satisfied

314
17:45.840 --> 17:47.350
with the children I've raised.

315
17:47.350 --> 17:48.950
Uncle, you're being modest.

316
17:49.940 --> 17:51.590
Lili, get us some fruit.

317
17:52.140 --> 17:53.290
I'll go with Yun Ye.

318
17:53.290 --> 17:54.090
Okay.

319
17:57.790 --> 17:58.900
What's going on?

320
17:59.290 --> 18:00.440
You haven't confessed yet, right?

321
18:00.440 --> 18:02.140
Why is Yunyi's brother already here?

322
18:02.140 --> 18:03.270
It's not about that.

323
18:03.330 --> 18:04.960
If not that, then what?

324
18:06.210 --> 18:08.090
My future sister-in-law's family is so strict.

325
18:08.090 --> 18:10.490
They're visiting before you even confess.

326
18:10.590 --> 18:11.290
Yun Ye.

327
18:11.520 --> 18:12.870
Maybe when you confess,

328
18:12.900 --> 18:13.750
Dad will even throw you

329
18:13.750 --> 18:14.960
a big banquet.

330
18:15.230 --> 18:16.590
It's not impossible.

331
18:16.700 --> 18:17.500
In your dreams.

332
18:17.500 --> 18:18.590
I'm just kidding.

333
18:18.760 --> 18:20.000
You're way off.

334
18:20.130 --> 18:21.990
It's not about me. It's about you.

335
18:22.250 --> 18:24.180
He's here for a blind date with you.

336
18:26.540 --> 18:27.800
Yin Yucheng and me?

337
18:29.640 --> 18:31.000
What's this about a blind date?

338
18:31.000 --> 18:31.880
I'll go clear things up.

339
18:31.880 --> 18:32.680
Wait, wait...

340
18:32.750 --> 18:33.810
Li, take it easy.

341
18:34.030 --> 18:35.700
Don't ruin my happiness.

342
18:39.240 --> 18:40.050
Mr. Yin.

343
18:40.640 --> 18:41.440
I'm sorry.

344
18:41.900 --> 18:43.110
This blind date

345
18:43.140 --> 18:44.740
must be a misunderstanding.

346
18:45.960 --> 18:46.750
Yun Li.

347
18:46.960 --> 18:47.740
What are you doing?

348
18:47.740 --> 18:48.800
You're being rude.

349
18:49.050 --> 18:50.290
I don't want a blind date.

350
18:50.290 --> 18:51.290
And I don't need one.

351
18:51.290 --> 18:52.830
I've told you many times.

352
18:53.500 --> 18:54.290
Uncle.

353
18:54.940 --> 18:56.740
There must be a misunderstanding.

354
18:56.740 --> 18:57.530
Actually, Yun Li and I

355
18:57.530 --> 18:58.850
have known each other for a long time.

356
18:58.850 --> 19:00.900
I mainly came today to pay you a visit

357
19:01.350 --> 19:02.750
and invite you to dinner.

358
19:03.330 --> 19:05.310
Unfortunately, I also have an appointment today.

359
19:05.310 --> 19:06.800
I'll find another time

360
19:06.820 --> 19:08.220
to treat you two to a meal.

361
19:11.640 --> 19:12.750
Yin, look.

362
19:13.240 --> 19:14.660
Sorry you had to witness that.

363
19:14.660 --> 19:15.590
When you go home,

364
19:15.660 --> 19:18.260
please apologize to your parents on my behalf.

365
19:18.310 --> 19:18.980
It's fine.

366
19:19.140 --> 19:20.680
I won't bother you two anymore.

367
19:20.680 --> 19:21.090
Okay.

368
19:21.720 --> 19:22.720
I'll walk you out.

369
19:30.550 --> 19:31.350
Okay.

370
19:43.590 --> 19:44.400
Yun Li.

371
19:45.140 --> 19:46.530
Where did you learn

372
19:46.530 --> 19:47.550
to be this rude?

373
19:48.550 --> 19:49.370
Dad, I've told you

374
19:49.370 --> 19:50.460
more than once.

375
19:50.770 --> 19:51.700
I don't want to go on blind dates,

376
19:51.700 --> 19:52.880
and I don't need blind dates.

377
19:52.880 --> 19:54.350
Can you stop making decisions for me?

378
19:54.350 --> 19:55.810
Making decisions for you?

379
19:56.030 --> 19:57.250
If you don't want me to interfere,

380
19:57.250 --> 19:57.940
bring back a

381
19:57.940 --> 19:59.250
decent boyfriend.

382
19:59.740 --> 20:00.640
Yin

383
20:01.660 --> 20:03.030
is highly educated and has a good job.

384
20:03.030 --> 20:04.900
The key is that he's from Xifu.

385
20:04.900 --> 20:05.700
And he doesn't mind

386
20:05.700 --> 20:06.590
that you're deaf in one ear!

387
20:06.590 --> 20:07.330
Dear!

388
20:10.140 --> 20:10.940
Yes.

389
20:11.290 --> 20:12.530
He has great qualifications,

390
20:12.530 --> 20:14.410
while your daughter can't hear in one ear.

391
20:14.410 --> 20:15.380
I won't put you in an awkward position.

392
20:15.380 --> 20:16.290
I'll make it clear to him myself.

393
20:16.290 --> 20:16.960
Lili!

394
20:18.000 --> 20:18.610
Dad.

395
20:18.940 --> 20:20.250
You've gone too far.

396
20:20.530 --> 20:21.390
Can you please consider

397
20:21.390 --> 20:22.460
Li's feelings?

398
20:24.500 --> 20:25.290
Senior Yin.

399
20:30.750 --> 20:32.140
Actually, Fu Shize and I

400
20:32.140 --> 20:33.140
are still dating.

401
20:33.860 --> 20:35.110
I didn't tell my dad.

402
20:38.200 --> 20:39.000
That's great.

403
20:39.940 --> 20:41.000
I wish you the best.

404
20:42.250 --> 20:44.000
I've told my dad many times,

405
20:44.020 --> 20:45.420
but he just won't listen.

406
20:46.050 --> 20:47.850
I'm really sorry about just now.

407
20:47.850 --> 20:48.910
It was so rude of us.

408
20:49.400 --> 20:50.200
It's fine.

409
20:50.940 --> 20:52.400
I was being presumptuous.

410
20:52.570 --> 20:55.030
When I heard the matchmaker describe this person,

411
20:55.030 --> 20:56.690
I thought it sounded like you.

412
20:56.830 --> 20:58.090
So I took a chance

413
20:58.090 --> 20:58.950
and came to see.

414
21:03.240 --> 21:04.370
I guess losing to him

415
21:05.500 --> 21:07.160
doesn't sting quite so much.

416
21:28.590 --> 21:29.940
Are you free now?

417
21:36.920 --> 21:37.510
Lili.

418
21:40.960 --> 21:43.020
Why did you come here so late at night?

419
21:50.240 --> 21:51.040
What's wrong?

420
21:51.830 --> 21:52.790
I missed you.

421
21:56.330 --> 21:57.750
Didn't we just part ways?

422
21:58.200 --> 21:59.330
You miss me already?

423
22:03.900 --> 22:04.700
What's wrong?

424
22:08.830 --> 22:09.790
What happened?

425
22:10.700 --> 22:11.500
It's my dad.

426
22:12.250 --> 22:13.460
He's so ridiculous.

427
22:13.460 --> 22:14.240
He invited Yin Yucheng over

428
22:14.240 --> 22:15.590
to set me up on a blind date.

429
22:15.590 --> 22:16.350
I had a fight with him

430
22:16.350 --> 22:17.410
and left the house.

431
22:19.840 --> 22:20.700
I just feel that

432
22:21.240 --> 22:22.000
since I was a child,

433
22:22.000 --> 22:24.800
I've never been able to communicate well with him.

434
22:26.140 --> 22:28.560
When I was young, it was because of my studies.

435
22:28.560 --> 22:30.090
As I grew older, he started deciding

436
22:30.090 --> 22:31.460
which university I should attend,

437
22:31.460 --> 22:32.530
what major I should choose,

438
22:32.530 --> 22:33.990
and what job I should take.

439
22:34.700 --> 22:35.500
Now,

440
22:35.790 --> 22:37.740
he's even arranging blind dates for me.

441
22:37.740 --> 22:38.460
I've already told him

442
22:38.460 --> 22:39.660
I don't need it and don't want to go,

443
22:39.660 --> 22:41.060
but he just won't listen.

444
22:43.250 --> 22:44.270
I can understand

445
22:44.270 --> 22:45.730
why he treats me like this.

446
22:45.740 --> 22:47.830
He thinks I've been introverted

447
22:48.290 --> 22:49.240
since I was a child,

448
22:49.240 --> 22:50.830
that I'm stubborn

449
22:51.050 --> 22:52.850
and can't get along with others.

450
22:52.960 --> 22:53.940
So he arranges everything

451
22:53.940 --> 22:55.240
perfectly for me.

452
22:55.400 --> 22:56.530
But growing up,

453
22:56.530 --> 22:57.660
I've always been working hard

454
22:57.660 --> 22:59.140
to tell him that

455
22:59.140 --> 22:59.960
even if I'm introverted,

456
22:59.960 --> 23:00.460
it doesn't mean

457
23:00.460 --> 23:01.750
I can't get along well with others.

458
23:01.750 --> 23:02.350
It doesn't mean

459
23:02.350 --> 23:03.790
I can't take good care of myself

460
23:03.790 --> 23:04.940
or make choices

461
23:04.940 --> 23:05.800
for my own life.

462
23:16.400 --> 23:17.140
Lili.

463
23:18.000 --> 23:19.570
I think your father

464
23:19.960 --> 23:20.920
probably hasn't seen

465
23:20.920 --> 23:21.920
your efforts yet.

466
23:22.860 --> 23:23.670
I believe that

467
23:23.690 --> 23:24.740
if he sees

468
23:25.290 --> 23:26.660
you've grown up

469
23:27.160 --> 23:27.960
and can make

470
23:27.960 --> 23:29.220
decisions on your own,

471
23:29.700 --> 23:30.900
he'll change.

472
23:32.900 --> 23:34.830
But I'm just really angry today.

473
23:35.290 --> 23:36.620
Do you know what he said?

474
23:38.030 --> 23:38.890
What did he say?

475
23:40.240 --> 23:41.700
He said Yin Yucheng

476
23:41.700 --> 23:43.050
is highly educated and has a good job,

477
23:43.050 --> 23:43.500
and doesn't mind

478
23:43.500 --> 23:44.900
that I'm deaf in one ear.

479
23:45.200 --> 23:46.030
He just wants to find me a family

480
23:46.030 --> 23:47.000
that won't look down on me,

481
23:47.000 --> 23:47.790
so I won't be mistreated

482
23:47.790 --> 23:48.990
after I marry into it.

483
23:52.830 --> 23:53.750
Your father really

484
23:53.750 --> 23:55.210
shouldn't have said that.

485
23:55.440 --> 23:57.300
I'm quite angry hearing that too.

486
23:58.460 --> 24:00.660
Why can't I hear the anger in your voice?

487
24:09.350 --> 24:10.010
Lili.

488
24:14.030 --> 24:15.030
Don't doubt yourself

489
24:15.030 --> 24:16.960
just because of others' opinions.

490
24:17.740 --> 24:19.140
You are very independent

491
24:19.530 --> 24:20.390
and ambitious.

492
24:21.700 --> 24:23.500
And you've achieved everything

493
24:23.590 --> 24:24.590
you wanted to do,

494
24:25.350 --> 24:26.160
haven't you?

495
24:27.900 --> 24:28.700
Have I?

496
24:28.940 --> 24:29.770
Of course.

497
24:32.830 --> 24:33.590
Parents

498
24:33.830 --> 24:35.230
have their own thoughts.

499
24:36.950 --> 24:37.760
Maybe

500
24:38.120 --> 24:38.840
those thoughts

501
24:38.840 --> 24:40.140
aren't perfect,

502
24:40.740 --> 24:42.800
and maybe we can't accept all of them.

503
24:43.660 --> 24:45.060
But parents are parents,

504
24:45.640 --> 24:46.640
and we are us.

505
24:47.330 --> 24:48.260
Don't you agree?

506
24:51.660 --> 24:52.360
Besides,

507
24:55.330 --> 24:56.140
in my eyes,

508
24:57.160 --> 24:57.960
you've always been someone

509
24:57.960 --> 24:58.850
who shines

510
25:00.590 --> 25:01.750
and never loses her sparkle

511
25:01.750 --> 25:03.480
just because others doubt her.

512
25:14.500 --> 25:15.830
Let me tell you a secret.

513
25:18.400 --> 25:20.750
Actually, your dad is just stubborn.

514
25:21.400 --> 25:23.460
You must be very special in his heart.

515
25:24.390 --> 25:25.180
That's why

516
25:26.640 --> 25:27.590
he was so against

517
25:27.590 --> 25:29.190
us being together last time.

518
25:31.090 --> 25:33.370
Don't listen to his nonsense.

519
25:33.500 --> 25:34.940
He just doesn't know you.

520
25:35.850 --> 25:36.710
Don't mind him.

521
25:37.200 --> 25:38.030
I don't mind.

522
25:39.460 --> 25:41.120
I only care about the present.

523
25:41.400 --> 25:42.350
And whether you're happy

524
25:42.350 --> 25:43.200
or sad,

525
25:44.700 --> 25:46.230
I'll always be by your side.

526
25:52.290 --> 25:55.640
Aren't you worried about my strict dad?

527
25:59.940 --> 26:00.700
I wouldn't dare speak ill

528
26:00.700 --> 26:02.300
of my future father-in-law.

529
26:07.740 --> 26:08.800
Let's find a chance

530
26:09.590 --> 26:10.590
for me to meet him.

531
26:11.460 --> 26:13.110
You don't mind how

532
26:13.140 --> 26:14.540
he treated you last time?

533
26:16.890 --> 26:17.680
As for that,

534
26:18.430 --> 26:20.090
you can't entirely blame him.

535
26:21.090 --> 26:22.680
I wasn't in a good state back then.

536
26:22.680 --> 26:23.530
Besides,

537
26:24.640 --> 26:25.350
he was just

538
26:25.350 --> 26:26.810
protecting his daughter.

539
26:27.850 --> 26:28.750
But if his protection

540
26:28.750 --> 26:29.740
hurts you,

541
26:32.220 --> 26:34.280
I'll bring you home as my wife sooner.

542
26:40.050 --> 26:41.590
I haven't agreed yet.

543
26:43.660 --> 26:45.240
Even if my dad agrees later,

544
26:45.240 --> 26:46.640
I might not.

545
26:49.290 --> 26:50.090
Then

546
26:50.550 --> 26:52.140
I'll just wait until you do.

547
26:55.940 --> 26:57.540
Why are you so pure-hearted?

548
26:59.300 --> 27:00.160
Pure-hearted?

549
27:29.790 --> 27:31.190
Am I still pure-hearted?

550
27:32.010 --> 27:33.480
That's not included.

551
27:42.330 --> 27:43.930
Alright, it's getting late.

552
27:44.330 --> 27:45.460
Let me take you home.

553
27:48.000 --> 27:49.290
Let's go home.

554
27:50.700 --> 27:51.960
I don't want to go back.

555
28:26.830 --> 28:27.960
Li, where did you go?

556
28:28.070 --> 28:30.070
Why didn't you reply to my messages?

557
28:33.090 --> 28:33.700
What's wrong?

558
28:33.700 --> 28:35.560
You didn't even read my messages?

559
28:35.890 --> 28:36.950
I didn't read them.

560
28:38.900 --> 28:39.630
You're back.

561
28:40.750 --> 28:42.210
The noodles are still hot.

562
28:42.350 --> 28:44.080
I'll go heat up the soup for you.

563
28:45.200 --> 28:46.010
Sit down, Li.

564
28:46.330 --> 28:46.920
Sit.

565
28:48.070 --> 28:48.590
Sit.

566
28:49.960 --> 28:50.900
I'll go help Dad.

567
29:13.330 --> 29:14.270
Say it.

568
29:16.720 --> 29:18.530
Say it, hurry up.

569
29:24.010 --> 29:25.010
I...

570
29:28.160 --> 29:29.030
I did this

571
29:29.030 --> 29:30.460
all for your own good.

572
29:36.450 --> 29:37.430
Dad, I've heard this

573
29:37.430 --> 29:39.500
so many times my left ear is calloused.

574
29:39.500 --> 29:40.420
Then you should know

575
29:40.420 --> 29:41.090
that I'm doing this

576
29:41.090 --> 29:42.240
all for your sake.

577
29:42.350 --> 29:43.250
With your temper and personality,

578
29:43.250 --> 29:44.500
if you end up in someone else's household

579
29:44.500 --> 29:45.210
and they wrong you,

580
29:45.210 --> 29:46.750
you'll just be stubborn and keep quiet.

581
29:46.750 --> 29:47.550
Dear.

582
29:49.640 --> 29:51.000
Didn't we agree

583
29:51.000 --> 29:52.640
to talk nicely?

584
29:57.250 --> 29:59.450
Actually, I'm already dating someone.

585
30:00.250 --> 30:01.200
So please don't arrange these

586
30:01.200 --> 30:02.090
blind dates for me anymore.

587
30:02.090 --> 30:03.000
It's not good.

588
30:03.200 --> 30:04.750
You have a boyfriend?

589
30:06.330 --> 30:07.110
Lili.

590
30:09.290 --> 30:10.750
Since when?

591
30:11.160 --> 30:11.940
Why didn't I hear

592
30:11.940 --> 30:13.200
you mention it?

593
30:13.790 --> 30:15.000
Just recently.

594
30:15.590 --> 30:16.750
I wanted to wait until it was stable

595
30:16.750 --> 30:17.880
before telling you.

596
30:18.960 --> 30:20.850
See? I told you not to rush it.

597
30:20.940 --> 30:22.590
You should have asked her first.

598
30:22.590 --> 30:23.500
Yes, yes.

599
30:23.530 --> 30:25.260
Look at the mess you made today.

600
30:25.940 --> 30:27.660
Wait, who are you dating?

601
30:28.340 --> 30:29.900
The teaching assistant in Yun Ye's class.

602
30:29.900 --> 30:31.060
A PhD student at XUST.

603
30:31.060 --> 30:32.000
He's graduating soon.

604
30:32.000 --> 30:32.790
Really?

605
30:34.290 --> 30:35.090
Really.

606
30:36.400 --> 30:37.810
So how is he?

607
30:39.590 --> 30:40.460
He's very nice.

608
30:41.050 --> 30:42.310
He treats me very well.

609
30:42.770 --> 30:44.200
Why didn't you say so earlier?

610
30:44.200 --> 30:45.200
When you have time,

611
30:45.200 --> 30:46.090
bring him over

612
30:46.090 --> 30:47.420
so we can meet him, okay?

613
30:47.900 --> 30:49.610
Dad, don't worry so much.

614
30:49.610 --> 30:50.660
What if you scare

615
30:50.660 --> 30:51.530
my sister's boyfriend away?

616
30:51.530 --> 30:52.640
Am I that scary?

617
30:52.640 --> 30:53.570
I won't eat him.

618
30:53.790 --> 30:55.090
What's there to be scared of?

619
30:55.090 --> 30:56.700
Is he not good enough for my daughter?

620
30:56.700 --> 30:57.710
No.

621
30:57.740 --> 30:59.790
Our teaching assistant is very impressive.

622
30:59.790 --> 31:01.390
He did his undergrad at XUST.

623
31:01.720 --> 31:02.310
And

624
31:02.310 --> 31:03.590
he gets national scholarships every year.

625
31:03.590 --> 31:05.010
He often wins first place in competitions.

626
31:05.010 --> 31:06.050
He's a really nice person,

627
31:06.050 --> 31:07.380
and he has a good temper.

628
31:07.590 --> 31:08.240
Also,

629
31:08.380 --> 31:09.810
he's very devoted.

630
31:09.810 --> 31:11.400
He's deeply in love with Li.

631
31:12.640 --> 31:14.500
Wait, if this boy is so excellent,

632
31:14.830 --> 31:16.290
has he never dated anyone?

633
31:17.480 --> 31:19.140
He's never dated anyone else.

634
31:22.460 --> 31:23.900
Sounds good.

635
31:24.520 --> 31:26.180
He's a good match for our Lili.

636
31:26.460 --> 31:27.250
Right, Dear?

637
31:28.140 --> 31:28.940
Yes.

638
31:29.290 --> 31:31.140
Then it's worth celebrating.

639
31:31.170 --> 31:31.780
Hey, Yun Ye,

640
31:31.780 --> 31:32.800
bring me my wine.

641
31:48.140 --> 31:48.990
Not bad.

642
31:50.220 --> 31:52.110
Dad, when you said "not bad,"

643
31:52.110 --> 31:53.110
did you mean the wine

644
31:53.110 --> 31:55.070
or my sister's boyfriend?

645
31:56.140 --> 31:56.940
Both.

646
32:07.250 --> 32:08.530
After achieving millimeter-level

647
32:08.530 --> 32:10.850
dynamic reconstruction of facial muscles,

648
32:10.850 --> 32:11.660
currently,

649
32:11.790 --> 32:12.660
our multimodal

650
32:12.660 --> 32:13.790
interaction system

651
32:13.790 --> 32:14.940
is nearing completion.

652
32:14.940 --> 32:15.940
On this basis,

653
32:16.160 --> 32:17.400
the applications of digital twins

654
32:17.400 --> 32:18.860
will be greatly expanded.

655
32:19.240 --> 32:20.030
Of course,

656
32:20.030 --> 32:21.000
in this field,

657
32:21.000 --> 32:22.400
we still have many key issues

658
32:22.400 --> 32:23.240
to solve,

659
32:23.590 --> 32:26.240
such as the risk of emotional dependence

660
32:26.440 --> 32:28.030
and the possibility of memory tampering.

661
32:28.030 --> 32:29.030
These challenges

662
32:29.500 --> 32:31.030
involve ethical safeguards

663
32:31.030 --> 32:32.430
and technical stability.

664
32:32.430 --> 32:33.830
They will also be our next

665
32:33.830 --> 32:35.350
key targets to overcome.

666
32:45.200 --> 32:46.000
Alright.

667
32:46.030 --> 32:47.090
That's all for today.

668
32:47.090 --> 32:48.020
Let's eat first.

669
32:48.830 --> 32:50.030
What did I say?

670
32:50.050 --> 32:51.160
Now that Senior is dating,

671
32:51.160 --> 32:52.760
we can finally catch a break.

672
32:56.740 --> 32:57.460
For me?

673
32:57.590 --> 32:58.160
Yes.

674
32:58.960 --> 32:59.850
For us.

675
33:01.770 --> 33:02.590
Sister-in-law,

676
33:02.590 --> 33:04.050
we'll go have our meals.

677
33:04.400 --> 33:05.500
Eat more, Senior.

678
33:10.750 --> 33:12.050
I always take up so much

679
33:12.050 --> 33:13.200
of your time.

680
33:13.330 --> 33:14.090
Will they think

681
33:14.090 --> 33:15.550
you're not doing your job?

682
