811
37:20.230 --> 37:20.650
We'll drink with you.

812
37:20.650 --> 37:21.050
We'll drink with you.

813
37:21.050 --> 37:21.670
We toast you.

814
37:21.670 --> 37:22.050
Right.

815
37:22.050 --> 37:23.070
